  <div id="f31ca42f-d937-400e-a2cb-e48a1e64fc0a" data-sid="z" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-2 section"><div class="container"><div class="grid-column-2 column-three-two"><div class="stack fill-height stack-center"><div class="r-10"><div class="media-wrapper media-large aspect-square"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/2f6f4cad-4e31-434b-9d10-38ba85f9daf7?v=tk93mq" srcset="/assets/2f6f4cad-4e31-434b-9d10-38ba85f9daf7-320?v=tk93mq 320w, /assets/2f6f4cad-4e31-434b-9d10-38ba85f9daf7-640?v=tk93mq 640w, /assets/2f6f4cad-4e31-434b-9d10-38ba85f9daf7-1280?v=tk93mq 1280w, /assets/2f6f4cad-4e31-434b-9d10-38ba85f9daf7?v=tk93mq 1857w" sizes="100vw" alt="Woman in a flowing dress and kangaroo sit beside an infinity pool overlooking a sunset-lit rocky coast." style="aspect-ratio: 1857 / 1200"></img></div></div></div><div class="stack fill-height stack-between"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>The point of view</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="14" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"Where the view is the only ornament.","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Where the view is the only ornament.</h2></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="stack"><p data-cid="g" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Fourteen limestone residences shaped around the Bondi–Tamarama headland. The buildings step down the slope, so no residence overlooks another, and nothing competes with the ocean."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Fourteen limestone residences shaped around the Bondi–Tamarama headland. The buildings step down the slope, so no residence overlooks another, and nothing competes with the ocean.</p><div class="r-15"><ul class="icon-list body-max-width"><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">check</span></span><p data-cid="l" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"One stone, from one quarry, throughout"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>One stone, from one quarry, throughout</p></li><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">check</span></span><p data-cid="o" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Restraint is the luxury"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Restraint is the luxury</p></li><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">check</span></span><p data-cid="r" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Built to age, not to impress"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Built to age, not to impress</p></li></ul></div></div><div class="button-group"><a data-cid="1a" data-props='{"buttonHierarchy":"Secondary","buttonSize":"Regular","buttonHasLeadingIcon":false,"LeadingIcon":"category","buttonHasTrailingIcon":false,"TrailingIcon":"arrow_forward","buttonLabel":"The material story","buttonLink":"78aeb46145c6401ebdf718fdb907cc2c","$index":0,"$count":1}' class="button button-secondary" href="78aeb46145c6401ebdf718fdb907cc2c" data-bind='{"attrs":{"href":"buttonLink"}}'><div style="margin: 0">The material story</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div id="f31ca42f-d937-400e-a2cb-e48a1e64fc0a-2" data-sid="1b" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section"><div class="container"><div class="grid-column-2 column-two-three"><div class="stack fill-height stack-between"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>The material story</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="14" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"One stone, from one quarry, throughout.","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>One stone, from one quarry, throughout.</h2></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="stack"><p data-cid="g" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Coralline limestone from a single quarry in Puglia, honed and used continuously across floors, walls, bathrooms and the entry colonnade — including a solid carved bath in every primary ensuite. Aged brass, European oak, linen."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Coralline limestone from a single quarry in Puglia, honed and used continuously across floors, walls, bathrooms and the entry colonnade — including a solid carved bath in every primary ensuite. Aged brass, European oak, linen.</p><div class="r-15"><ul class="icon-list body-max-width"><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">check</span></span><p data-cid="l" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"A solid carved bath in every primary ensuite"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"